# Phase 9: keep Docker build contexts small and free of secrets/user files.
# Context for both images is the repository root (pnpm workspace).

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Never bake user configuration or secrets into images or build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Version control and local tooling
.git
.gitignore

# Documentation and planning artifacts (not needed at build time)
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Test artifacts (temp media, test databases, tmip_test dumps)
tmip_test*
**/tmp
**/.vitest
**/coverage
